 roduction returns\, casting scorching light on the lust\, violence and de
 structive desire of Bizet’s ever-popular opera. An all-star cast brings t
 his white-hot drama to life\, with Ginger Costa-Jackson in the fiery title
  role\, alongside Russell Thomas as the jealous and despairing Don José. 
